  "plain": "A documentary filmmaker named James Fox tells a story from Varginha, a town in Brazil, where people say a strange creature was captured in January 1996. Relaying an account tied to a man named Marco Chereze, Fox says the creature was brought to a clinic, and the doctor there said, in effect, that he did not know what the thing was, but they should get it out of there. If true, it would mean a medical worker saw a living being nobody could identify."
